<title>UK: DePfa sets 100 mln mark 10-year REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 100 mln mark 10-year REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers GZB Bank and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *6.0	 MATURITY    27.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    27.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) ONE	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  2.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST YEAR THEN 80 PCT OF THE 10-YEAR REX</p>
<p>		 INDEX THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
